  "unreadable": [],
  "notes": "Image shows an Arduino Nano ESP32 seated on the Alvik carrier; Nano silkscreen labels are visible for 13 of 15 pins per row. Position 12 (top) and 14 (bottom) have a blank white silkscreen box and no text; they are labelled GND because the carrier's GND callouts point to the holes in those columns. The carrier callouts '3V3' and 'PWR_Status' point to the holes in the D2 and RX0 columns of the top row, and 'VIN' to the VIN column of the bottom row; the 3V3/PWR_Status callouts conflict with the Nano silkscreen and are not merged into the pin entries - needs human review."
